    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "McGovern Estates is delighted to present No. 90 Charlesland Wood to the market.\r\n\r\nThis beautiful two-bedroom mid-terrace townhouse is ideally situated in a private cul-de-sac setting within the desirable Charlesland development.\r\nPresented in immaculate condition throughout, this beautiful home offers bright and well-proportioned accommodation, complemented by a large converted attic space providing valuable additional living and storage accommodation, fully refurbished bathroom and double glazing throughout. \r\n\r\nNo. 90 Charlesland Wood represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a property in turn key condition in a popular and well-established development of Greystones. Early internal viewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\nExtending to 95.6m2 (1,029.03sq.ft.) including the converted attic space,  the property comprises an entrance hall, living room, kitchen, dining/ living room, downstairs WC, two bedrooms, family bathroom and converted attic space.\r\n\r\nGreystones Town is within easy reach offering a wonderful selection of restaurants, boutiques, and shops and a large number of highly regarded schools. A host of sport and leisure clubs abound in the area including sailing, rowing, football, rugby, tennis and GAA. The Shoreline Leisure Centre and swimming pool is close by, as are a great choice of renowned golf clubs, including Greystones, Powerscourt and Druids Glen.\r\n\r\nGreystones is situated in a stunning location between the coast and the Wicklow mountains, giving easy access to the local beaches, countryside and nearby villages of Delgany and Enniskerry.\r\n\r\nThe commuter will be delighted at the easy access to local bus stops and the DART station both within walking distance. The N11/M50 is also within easy reach making for an easy commute. to the city, airport and beyond."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance  Hallway\r\nLaminated wood flooring, alarm panel, gas boiler, door to living room. \r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\nLaminated wood flooring, feature electric fire with polished stone mantle and black slate inset and hearth, windows overlooking  amenity green.\r\n\r\nKitchen\r\nTiled flooring, fully fitted kitchen, floor and wall based storage cupboards, integrated appliances, stainless steel sink unit, gas hob, polished black granite countertops, recessed lighting.\r\n\r\nDining/ Living Room\r\nLaminated wood flooring, recess lighting, French doors to rear garden. \r\n\r\nDownstairs WC\r\nTiled flooring, WC with concealed cistern, wash hand basin, wall mirror, additional under stairs storage, recessed lighting, extractor fan. \r\n\r\nLanding\r\nCarpeted flooring,  smoke alarm. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\nCarpeted flooring, floor to ceiling built in wardrobes, overlooking large amenity green.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 \r\nLaminated wood flooring, floor to ceiling built in wardrobes, under stairs storage, smoke alarm, overlooking rear garden.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom\r\nTiled flooring, WC, wall hung wash hand basin with storage, wall mirror with lighting, fully tiled double shower unit with drench head mains power shower and  telephone hand shower, chrome heated towel rail, recessed lighting, extractor fan.\r\n\r\nAttic Conversion\r\nCarpeted flooring, additional eaves storage, 3 x Velux windows, recessed lighting, smoke alarm.\r\n\r\nRear Garden\r\nPrivate rear garden with Indian Sandstone paving and grass lawn, raised flower beds, timber framed garden shed, concrete and timber framed fencing.\r\n\r\nFront Garden\r\nCobblelock driveway, mature hedging and off street parking."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Cul de sac setting \r\nCobblelock driveway\r\nOff-street parking Overlooking mature amenity green\r\nEnviable ‘C’ BER rating\r\nDouble glazing throughout\r\nConverted attic space\r\nRefurbished bathroom\r\nPrivate rear garden\r\nTimber framed garden shed\r\nTimber frame fencing with concrete posts \r\nGas fired central heating\r\nFitted with Eircom phonewatch alarm\r\nWalking distance to Charlesland shopping centre and public bus services\r\nBroadband available"
      },
      {
